title: Strikes!
subtitle: Strikes have begun, with or without the support of union leaders.
view-if: strikes_timer = 0 and union_unrest >= 35
new-page: true
max-visits: 6
on-arrival: {!
	Q.strikes_timer += 2
	Q.union_strength -= 3
	Q.union_unrest += 3
!}
tags: event

= Strikes!

Strikes have broken out in several industries over poor pay, mistreatment, and shrinking rations.[? if burgfrieden = 1 : These strikes are unauthorized by union leaders, who are desperately trying to win back over the workers.?] 

It is up to us as to whether we support these strikes, or take advantage of the situation.

- @support: Support the strikers!
- @blame: Blame the bourgeois parties for their poor conditions.
- @nothing: There is nothing we can do.
# - @return_work: Ask the strikers to return to work.

# @return_work
# subtitle: This is unpopular amongst the workers.
# on-arrival: {!
# 	Q.union_unrest += 5
# 	Q.union_support -= 5
# 	Q.grassroots_support -= 4

# 	Q.workers_spd -= 5
# 	Q.unemployed_spd -= 3
# !}

# The striking workers are quite unhappy with the direction we have taken.

@support
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {!
	Q.resources -= 1
	Q.aid_given += 1 /* perhaps after it reaches a certain level some members are arrested for supporting illegal strikes, todo */

	Q.union_strength += 6
	Q.union_support += 4

	Q.grassroots_support += 4

	if (Q.uspd_formed == 0) {Q.workers_spd += 5*(1-Q.dissent)}
	if (Q.uspd_formed == 1 && Q.kpd_formed == 0) {Q.workers_uspd += 5*(1-Q.dissent)}
	if (Q.uspd_formed == 1 && Q.kpd_formed == 1) {Q.workers_kpd += 5*(1-Q.dissent)}
!}

We have delivered aid to the workers on strike. 

@blame
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
view-if: uspd_formed
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {!
	Q.resources -= 1

	Q.workers_ddp -= 5
	Q.workers_z -= 5
	Q.workers_dvp -= 5

	if (Q.kpd_formed == 1) {Q.workers_kpd += 6*(1-Q.dissent)}
	if (Q.kpd_formed == 0 && Q.uspd_formed == 1) {Q.workers_uspd += 6*(1-Q.dissent)}

	Q.ddp_relation -= 3
	Q.z_relation -= 3
	Q.dvp_relation -= 3

!}

We agitate amongst the striking workers, placing the blame on the capitalists and the parties that support them. The bourgeois parties ([+ ddp_name +], Z, [+ dvp_name +]) are unhappy with our actions.

@nothing
on-arrival: {!
	Q.union_support -= 2
	Q.grassroots_support -= 1
	Q.union_unrest += 2

	if (Q.uspd_formed == 0) {Q.workers_spd -= 3}
	if (Q.uspd_formed == 1 && Q.kpd_formed == 0) {Q.workers_uspd -= 3}
	if (Q.uspd_formed == 1 && Q.kpd_formed == 1) {Q.workers_kpd -= 3}
!}

There is nothing we can do. Maybe the strikers and the companies will come to an agreement on their own.